{"format_version": 2, "segments": [{"kind": "text", "text": " μέλω, Med. μέλομαι, used in both voices, either in neut. sense, to be an object of care or thought, or in act. sense, care for, take an interest in. pres. μέλω: impf. ἔμελον, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μέλον Od. 5.6", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": ["Ep."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": fut. μελήσω, inf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μελησέμεν Il. 10.51", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": ["Ep."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": aor. ἐμέλησα: pf. μεμέληκα; also Ep. and Lyr. μέμηλα, part. μεμα—λώς dub. in "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pi. O. 1.89", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": ["Dor."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (for Ep. forms of Med. v.infr."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "111.2", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": ["Dor."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": "): almost always 3 sg. and pl., exc. in pres. (v. infr.):— to be an object of care or thought, sts. with a personal subject (not in Att. Prose): πᾶσι δόλοισιν ἀνθρώποισι μέλω by all manner of wiles am I in men's thoughts, i. e. am well known to them, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 9.20", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ἀργὼ πᾶσι μέλουσα 12.70", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μελήσεις ἄφθιτον ἀνθρώποις αἰὲν ἔχων ὄνομα Thgn. 245", "author_abbreviation": "Thgn.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Εὐθυμίᾳ μέλων εἴην Pi. Fr. 155", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μέλει σφισὶ Καλλιόπα Id. O. 10(11).14", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἵνα θανοῦσα νερτέροισιν μέλω E. Andr. 850", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (lyr.); "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ἔρως . . οὐρανίδαισι μέλων Id. Tr. 842", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "011", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μέλων πολλοῖσι AP 5.121", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " ("}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Diod.", "author_abbreviation": "Diod.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "); "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἡ μέλουσα ἀγέλη Them. Or. 1.10a", "author_abbreviation": "Them.", "tlg_author": "2001", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": pf. part., ἀρεταῖσι μεμαλότας dear to virtue, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pi. O. 1.89", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (dub.); μέλεγάρ οἱ [Ὀδυσσεύς] "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 5.6", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὸν ξεῖνον δὲ ἐῶμεν . . . Τηλεμάχῳ μελέμεν 18.420", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": but more freq. of things, μή τοι ταῦτα . . . μελόντων let not these things weigh on thy soul, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 18.463", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 13.362", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μηδέ τί οἱ θάνατος μελέτω φρεσί Il. 24.152", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; σοὶ χρὴ τάδε πάντα μέλειν 'tis good these things should be a care to thee, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "5.490", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "πόλεμος δ' ἄνδρεσσι μελήσει 6.492", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μελήσουσιν δ' ἐμοὶ ἵπποι 5.228", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ᾧ τόσσα μέμηλε 2.25", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οἷς ὕβρις μέμηλε κακή Hes. Op. 238", "author_abbreviation": "Hes.", "tlg_author": "0020", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τοῖσιν . . ἐνὶ φρεσὶν ἄλλα μεμήλει Od. 1.151", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 2.614", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὅσα φημὶ μελησέμεν Ἀργείοισι 10.51", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἔλεγε . . κομιδῆς πέρι τὴν ὥρην αὐτῷ μελήσειν Hdt. 8.19", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μέλει γὰρ ἀνδρὶ . . τἄξωθεν A. Th. 200", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "σοὶ χρὴ μέλειν ἐπιστολάς Id. Pr. 3", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὗτος . . δμωσὶν ἂν μέλοι πόνος E. Supp. 939", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "008", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἃ τοῖσιν ἀστοῖς ἔμελεν Ar. Ec. 459", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τοῖσδε μελήσει γάμος E. El. 1342", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "012", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (anap.); "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τοῦτο ἴσασιν ἐμοὶ μεμεληκός X. Ap. 20", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". impers. c. inf., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὐκ ἔμελέν μοι ταῦτα μεταλλῆσαι Od. 16.465", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; so in "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. Ag. 1250", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Th. 1.141", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; also, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μοι ἐμέλησεν ὥστε εἰδέναι X. Cyr. 6.3.19", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": united with the personal construction, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὗτος μητρὶ κηδεύειν μέλει E. Rh. 983", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "019", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". less freq. with a Conj., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὐ μέλειν οἱ ὅτι ἀποθνῄσκει Hdt. 9.72", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; σοὶ μελέτω ὅκως . . "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Id. 1.9", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. An. 1.8.13", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὡς δὲ καλῶς ἕξει . . , ἐμοὶ μελήσει Id. Cyr. 3.2.13", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἐμοὶ τοῦτο μέλει, μὴ . . "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. Ph. 1121", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (lyr.); οὐ τοσοῦτόν μοι μέλει εἰ . . "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Lys. 21.12", "author_abbreviation": "Lys.", "tlg_author": "0540", "tlg_work": "021", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". 3 sg. is freq. used impers. with the object in gen., and pers. in dat., ᾧ μέλει μάχας to whom there is care for the battle, who careth for it, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. Ch. 946", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (lyr.), cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ag. 974", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐμοὶ δ' ἔλασσον Ζηνὸς ἢ μηδὲν μέλει Id. Pr. 938", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "θεοῖσιν εἰ δίκης μέλει S. Ph. 1036", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ζηνὶ τῶν σῶν μέλει πόνων E. Heracl. 717", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "πάνυ μοι τυγχάνει μεμεληκὸς τοῦ ᾄσματος Pl. Prt. 339b", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "022", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; also "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μέλει μοι περί τινος A. Ch. 780", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ar. Lys. 502", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Alc. 2.150d", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μεμέληκέ μοι περὶ αὐτῶν Id. Cra. 428b", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": less freq. with "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὑπέρ, εἴπερ ὑπὲρ τοῦ κοινῇ βελτίστου δεῖ μέλειν ὑμῖν D. 21.37", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "021", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". abs., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μηδέ σοι μελησάτω A. Pr. 334", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; οἶμαι θεοῖς τοῖς κάτω μέλειν, οἳ (nisi leg. οἷς)"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἠδίκηνται Antipho 1.31", "author_abbreviation": "Antipho", "tlg_author": "0028", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". freq. with a neg., οὐδέν μοι μέλει I care not, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ar. Ra. 655", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "009", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μή νυν μελέτω σοι μηδέν Id. Pl. 208", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "011", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τῷ δ' οὐδὲν μ. Alex. 178.2", "author_abbreviation": "Alex.", "tlg_author": "0402", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; so τί δέ σοι μέλει; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Diph. 73.10", "author_abbreviation": "Diph.", "tlg_author": "0447", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". μέλον ἔστι periphr. for μέλει, as "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τοῖσδ' ἔσται μ. S. OC 653", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1433", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". neut. part. used abs., οὐδὲν ἄρ' ἐμοῦ μέλον for they took no thought of me, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ar. V. 1288", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; δῆλον ὅτι οἶσθα, μέλον γέ σοι since you care about it, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Ap. 24d", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὐδὲν αὐτῷ μ. τοῦ τοιούτου Id. Phdr. 235a", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "012", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μ. αὐτοῖς ἰσχυρῶς ὅπῃ τὸ μέλλον ἀποβήσοιτο X. Cyr. 5.2.24", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὔτε σκοπούμεναι οὔτε μ. αὐταῖς ἄλλο ἢ 